<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Jimin Lee is a product manager specializing in enterprise integrations, developer platforms, and third-party ecosystems."
    />
    <title>Jimin Lee — Product Manager, Integrations & Developer Platforms</title>

    <!-- Fast prototype only: use the already-installed @fontsource files when this moves into Astro. -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wdth,wght@75..125,400..900&family=Source+Serif+4:opsz,wght@8..60,400..700&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />

    <style>
      :root {
        --paper: #faf7f0;
        --paper-raised: #ffffff;
        --ink: #1a1815;
        --ink-soft: #57534a;
        --rule: #ddd8cc;
        --cobalt: #0f4c9a;
        --cobalt-light: #7d9ec8;
        --font-display: "Archivo", sans-serif;
        --font-body: "Source Serif 4", Georgia, serif;
        --wrap: 1240px;
        --pad: clamp(20px, 4vw, 56px);
        --section-space: clamp(96px, 13vw, 184px);
      }

      *,
      *::before,
      *::after {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      * {
        margin: 0;
      }

      html {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
        text-underline-offset: 0.18em;
      }

      body {
        background: var(--paper);
        color: var(--ink);
        font-family: var(--font-body);
        font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.25vw, 1.18rem);
        line-height: 1.62;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
      }

      img,
      picture {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
      }

      a {
        color: inherit;
        text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
        text-decoration-color: var(--cobalt);
        text-decoration-skip-ink: auto;
      }

      a:hover {
        text-decoration-thickness: 4px;
      }

      a:active {
        opacity: 0.72;
      }

      a:focus-visible {
        outline: 3px solid currentColor;
        outline-offset: 5px;
      }

      h1,
      h2,
      h3 {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        line-height: 0.96;
        letter-spacing: -0.055em;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: clamp(5rem, 14.2vw, 12.75rem);
        font-stretch: 78%;
        font-weight: 900;
      }

      h2 {
        max-width: 9ch;
        font-size: clamp(3.6rem, 8vw, 8rem);
        font-stretch: 82%;
        font-weight: 850;
      }

      h3 {
        font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 3.1vw, 3rem);
        font-weight: 760;
      }

      .container-inner {
        width: min(100%, var(--wrap));
        margin-inline: auto;
        padding-inline: var(--pad);
      }

      .skip-link {
        position: fixed;
        z-index: 100;
        top: 16px;
        left: 16px;
        padding: 10px 14px;
        background: var(--paper);
        color: var(--ink);
        transform: translateY(-160%);
      }

      .skip-link:focus {
        transform: translateY(0);
      }

      .hero {
        min-height: 100svh;
        overflow: hidden;
        background: var(--cobalt);
        color: var(--paper);
      }

      .site-header {
        position: sticky;
        z-index: 50;
        top: 0;
        background: var(--cobalt);
        color: var(--paper);
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 0.94rem;
        font-weight: 650;
      }

      .site-header-inner {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 28px;
        min-height: 92px;
      }

      .wordmark {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        min-height: 44px;
        font-size: 1.18rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: -0.035em;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .nav-list {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: flex-end;
        gap: clamp(6px, 2vw, 28px);
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
      }

      .nav-list a {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        min-height: 44px;
        padding-inline: 7px;
        text-decoration-color: var(--paper);
      }

      .hero-title {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
        margin-top: clamp(32px, 8svh, 92px);
        white-space: nowrap;
      }

      .hero-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 6.5fr) minmax(300px, 4.5fr);
        gap: clamp(40px, 7vw, 92px);
        align-items: start;
        margin-top: clamp(24px, 5svh, 56px);
      }

      .hero-copy {
        max-width: 31em;
        padding-bottom: clamp(72px, 10vw, 132px);
        font-size: clamp(1.23rem, 2vw, 1.72rem);
        line-height: 1.46;
      }

      .hero-copy p + p {
        margin-top: 1.15em;
      }

      .hero-thesis {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 2.8vw, 2.65rem);
        font-weight: 760;
        line-height: 1.08;
        letter-spacing: -0.035em;
      }

      .hero-links {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px clamp(32px, 5vw, 72px);
        width: 100%;
        margin-top: clamp(18px, 3svh, 32px);
        padding: 16px 20px;
        background: var(--paper);
        color: var(--ink);
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: clamp(1.08rem, 1.45vw, 1.3rem);
        line-height: 1.25;
      }

      .hero-contact-actions,
      .hero-status {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 4px clamp(24px, 3vw, 44px);
      }

      .hero-contact-actions {
        font-weight: 760;
      }

      .hero-status {
        justify-content: flex-end;
        font-weight: 620;
      }

      .hero-links a,
      .hero-links span {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        min-height: 44px;
      }

      .hero-links a {
        text-decoration-color: var(--cobalt);
      }

      .portrait-shell {
        position: relative;
        align-self: start;
        width: 100%;
        min-height: 0;
        aspect-ratio: 2 / 3;
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--paper) 45%, transparent);
        border-radius: 50% 50% 0 0 / 28% 28% 0 0;
        background: var(--rule);
        color: var(--ink-soft);
      }

      .portrait-placeholder {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        padding: 24px;
        text-align: center;
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        font-weight: 650;
      }

      .portrait-image {
        position: absolute;
        z-index: 1;
        inset: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
      }

      .portrait-placeholder span {
        max-width: 16ch;
      }

      .section {
        padding-block: var(--section-space);
        scroll-margin-top: 112px;
      }

      #about,
      #education,
      #interests {
        scroll-margin-top: 112px;
      }

      .work {
        background: var(--paper-raised);
      }

      .work-intro {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(300px, 1.1fr);
        gap: clamp(40px, 10vw, 144px);
        align-items: end;
      }

      .work-intro p {
        max-width: 31em;
        padding-bottom: 9px;
        font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 1.75vw, 1.48rem);
      }

      .experience-list {
        display: grid;
        gap: clamp(84px, 10vw, 132px);
        margin-top: clamp(88px, 11vw, 148px);
      }

      .experience {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(210px, 0.72fr) minmax(0, 1.28fr);
        gap: clamp(36px, 8vw, 116px);
        align-items: start;
      }

      .experience:nth-child(even) {
        width: min(100%, 1020px);
        margin-left: auto;
      }

      .experience-meta {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 1rem;
        line-height: 1.45;
      }

      .experience-meta p + p {
        margin-top: 0.55em;
      }

      .experience-meta .role {
        color: var(--ink-soft);
      }

      .experience-story {
        max-width: 36em;
      }

      .experience-story h3 {
        margin-bottom: 0.7em;
      }

      .experience-story p {
        font-size: clamp(1.12rem, 1.55vw, 1.34rem);
      }

      .experience-story p + p {
        margin-top: 1em;
      }

      .earlier-role {
        max-width: 42em;
        margin-top: clamp(72px, 9vw, 112px);
        margin-left: auto;
        font-size: clamp(1.06rem, 1.35vw, 1.22rem);
      }

      .earlier-role strong {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
      }

      .support-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: clamp(56px, 11vw, 148px);
        align-items: start;
      }

      .support-block h2 {
        margin-bottom: clamp(36px, 5vw, 62px);
        font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6.2rem);
      }

      .support-block h3 {
        margin-bottom: 0.52em;
        font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.4vw, 2.35rem);
      }

      .support-meta {
        margin-top: 0.65em;
        color: var(--ink-soft);
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 1rem;
        line-height: 1.55;
      }

      .education-note {
        max-width: 30em;
        margin-top: 24px;
      }

      .interests-list {
        display: grid;
        gap: 28px;
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
      }

      .interests-list li {
        max-width: 29em;
        font-size: clamp(1.12rem, 1.55vw, 1.34rem);
      }

      .places {
        overflow: hidden;
        background: var(--ink);
        color: var(--paper);
        padding-block: clamp(88px, 10vw, 136px);
      }

      .places h2,
      .places h3 {
        color: inherit;
      }

      .places-intro {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(270px, 0.85fr);
        gap: clamp(40px, 10vw, 150px);
        align-items: end;
      }

      .places-intro h2 {
        max-width: 10ch;
      }

      .places-intro p {
        max-width: 28em;
        padding-bottom: 8px;
        color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--paper) 80%, transparent);
        font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 1.7vw, 1.45rem);
      }

      .place-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr));
        row-gap: clamp(64px, 8vw, 104px);
        margin-top: clamp(72px, 9vw, 116px);
      }

      .place {
        max-width: 31em;
      }

      .place:nth-child(1) {
        grid-column: 1 / span 5;
      }

      .place:nth-child(2) {
        grid-column: 7 / span 6;
        padding-top: 72px;
      }

      .place:nth-child(3) {
        grid-column: 4 / span 6;
      }

      .place:nth-child(4) {
        grid-column: 1 / span 5;
      }

      .place:nth-child(5) {
        grid-column: 7 / span 6;
        padding-top: 72px;
      }

      .place h3 {
        color: var(--cobalt-light);
        font-size: clamp(3rem, 5.6vw, 5.9rem);
        line-height: 0.9;
      }

      .place .region {
        margin-top: 16px;
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: 620;
      }

      .place .note {
        margin-top: 22px;
        color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--paper) 82%, transparent);
      }

      .contact {
        background: var(--paper);
      }

      .contact-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(270px, 0.8fr);
        gap: clamp(48px, 10vw, 160px);
        align-items: end;
      }

      .contact h2 {
        max-width: 10ch;
      }

      .contact-copy {
        max-width: 30em;
      }

      .contact-copy p {
        font-size: clamp(1.16rem, 1.65vw, 1.42rem);
      }

      .contact-links {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 8px 24px;
        margin-top: 30px;
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-weight: 650;
      }

      .contact-links a {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        min-height: 44px;
      }

      .footer {
        padding-block: 36px 46px;
        background: var(--paper);
        color: var(--ink-soft);
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }

      .footer .container-inner {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 24px;
      }

      @media (max-width: 980px) {
        .hero-grid {
          grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(260px, 0.72fr);
          gap: 40px;
        }

        .portrait-shell {
          min-height: 0;
        }

        .work-intro,
        .places-intro,
        .contact-grid {
          gap: 56px;
        }

        .experience {
          grid-template-columns: minmax(180px, 0.64fr) minmax(0, 1.36fr);
          gap: 48px;
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 760px) {
        .section,
        #about,
        #education,
        #interests {
          scroll-margin-top: 132px;
        }

        .site-header-inner {
          align-items: flex-start;
          padding-block: 19px;
        }

        .nav-list {
          max-width: 220px;
          flex-wrap: wrap;
          justify-content: flex-end;
          gap: 0 8px;
        }

        .hero-title {
          margin-top: 42px;
          white-space: normal;
        }

        .hero-grid,
        .work-intro,
        .experience,
        .support-grid,
        .places-intro,
        .contact-grid {
          grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
        }

        .hero-grid {
          gap: 36px;
          margin-top: 32px;
        }

        .hero-links {
          grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
          gap: 0;
          padding: 12px 16px;
        }

        .hero-status {
          justify-content: flex-start;
        }

        .portrait-shell {
          order: -1;
          width: min(72vw, 360px);
          min-height: 0;
          margin-left: auto;
          aspect-ratio: 2 / 3;
        }

        .hero-copy {
          padding-bottom: 0;
        }

        .work-intro p,
        .places-intro p {
          padding-bottom: 0;
        }

        .experience:nth-child(even) {
          width: 100%;
          margin-left: 0;
        }

        .experience-story h3 {
          margin-top: 12px;
        }

        .support-grid {
          gap: 96px;
        }

        .place-grid {
          grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
        }

        .place:nth-child(1),
        .place:nth-child(2),
        .place:nth-child(3),
        .place:nth-child(4),
        .place:nth-child(5) {
          grid-column: 1;
          max-width: 34em;
          padding-top: 0;
        }

        .place:nth-child(even) {
          margin-left: clamp(0px, 12vw, 72px);
        }

        .contact-copy {
          margin-left: 0;
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 480px) {
        :root {
          --pad: 20px;
          --section-space: 88px;
        }

        html {
          scroll-behavior: auto;
        }

        .site-header-inner {
          display: block;
          min-height: auto;
          padding-block: 8px;
        }

        .nav-list {
          max-width: none;
          justify-content: flex-start;
          margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .hero-title {
          font-size: clamp(4.3rem, 24vw, 7rem);
        }

        .portrait-shell {
          width: 100%;
          min-height: 0;
        }

        .hero-copy {
          font-size: 1.16rem;
        }

        .footer .container-inner {
          display: block;
        }

        .footer p + p {
          margin-top: 8px;
        }
      }

      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        *,
        *::before,
        *::after {
          scroll-behavior: auto !important;
        }
      }
      .launch-status { justify-content: flex-end; }

    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>

    <header class="site-header">
      <div class="container-inner site-header-inner">
        <a class="wordmark" href="#about">Jimin Lee</a>
        <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
          <ul class="nav-list">
            <li><a href="#work">Work</a></li>
            <li><a href="#education">Education</a></li>
            <li><a href="#places">Experiences</a></li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main id="main">
      <section class="hero" id="about" aria-labelledby="page-title">
        <div class="container-inner">
          <h1 class="hero-title" id="page-title">JIMIN LEE</h1>

          <div class="hero-links launch-status" aria-label="Location and work authorization">
            <div class="hero-status">
              <span>Toronto, Canada</span>
              <span>Authorized to work in Canada</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-grid">
            <div class="hero-copy">
              <p class="hero-thesis">I work on the systems that let products connect.</p>
              <p>
                I’m a product manager specializing in enterprise integrations and developer
                platforms for B2B SaaS. At NAVER Cloud, I led product planning for a shared
                third-party app platform serving LINE WORKS in Japan and NAVER WORKS in Korea.
              </p>
              <p>
                My scope ran from the App Console and App Market to partner onboarding,
                developer documentation, and lifecycle operations. I’m most at home turning
                repeated partner needs and manual operations into reusable product capabilities.
              </p>
            </div>

            <figure class="portrait-shell">
              <div class="portrait-placeholder" role="img" aria-label="Portrait placeholder">
                <span>Portrait of Jimin Lee</span>
              </div>
              <img
                class="portrait-image"
                src="data:image/jpeg;base64,"
                alt="Portrait of Jimin Lee"
                hidden
                onload="this.hidden = false; this.previousElementSibling.hidden = true"
              />
            </figure>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section work" id="work" aria-labelledby="work-heading">
        <div class="container-inner">
          <div class="work-intro">
            <h2 id="work-heading">Work experience</h2>
            <p>
              At NAVER Cloud, the same ecosystem looked different depending on where I
              stood: at the shared platform level, beside a partner moving an app, or in
              the internal workflows used to review, publish, and operate apps.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="experience-list">
            <article class="experience">
              <div class="experience-meta">
                <p><strong>NAVER Cloud Corp.</strong></p>
                <p>Seongnam, South Korea · Korea–Japan product scope</p>
              </div>
              <div class="experience-story">
                <h3>One platform, two markets</h3>
                <p>
                  Third-party app ecosystems from multiple enterprise software products
                  were moving onto a shared WORKS platform. I led product planning for the
                  consolidation, extending capabilities already serving LINE WORKS in Japan
                  to launch the NAVER WORKS App Market and App Console in Korea.
                </p>
                <p>
                  I defined product- and market-specific requirements for app types,
                  marketplace visibility and distribution, installation, and paid-app
                  setup and lifecycle workflows. The work included license-based plans and
                  metering APIs, developed in partnership with the billing product team.
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="experience">
              <div class="experience-meta">
                <p><strong>Partner migration</strong></p>
                <p class="role">Four paid third-party apps</p>
                <p>Requirements through post-launch</p>
              </div>
              <div class="experience-story">
                <h3>Four app migrations, end to end</h3>
                <p>
                  Four existing paid third-party apps needed to move onto the shared
                  platform. I led the work from requirements alignment and technical
                  guidance through testing, marketplace release, and post-launch support.
                </p>
                <p>
                  After migration, installed domains and users each increased by an
                  average of 50% across the four apps.
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="experience">
              <div class="experience-meta">
                <p><strong>Platform operations</strong></p>
                <p class="role">Review, permissions, lifecycle, and developer experience</p>
                <p>Concept through phased releases</p>
              </div>
              <div class="experience-story">
                <h3>The platform behind the marketplace</h3>
                <p>
                  I led product planning for an internal app-operations platform from
                  concept through phased releases. The platform replaced recurring
                  engineer-mediated work with role-based workflows for app review,
                  publishing, permissions, visibility, installation data, and pre-release
                  testing.
                </p>
                <p>
                  I also defined product requirements and policies for OIDC-based
                  authentication, OAuth 2.0 authorization, API access, scopes, and
                  permissions. When backend contracts changed, I translated them into App
                  Console workflows and developer documentation, then managed partner
                  communications, grace periods, staged rollouts, and deprecation planning.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Alongside that work, I replaced static PDF guides with a maintained,
                  self-service developer site and managed review and lifecycle operations
                  for first- and third-party apps and integrations across Korea and Japan.
                </p>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>

          <p class="earlier-role">
            <strong>Earlier:</strong> I was a marketing intern on Kakao Work at Kakao
            Enterprise, where I analyzed campaign performance and developed customer-facing
            content for the enterprise collaboration product (September 2020–February 2021).
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="section">
        <div class="container-inner support-grid">
          <section class="support-block" id="education" aria-labelledby="education-heading">
            <h2 id="education-heading">Education</h2>
            <h3>Seoul National University</h3>
            <p>
              B.A. in Chinese Language and Literature, with a double major in Linguistics
              and an interdisciplinary major in Humanities Data Science.
            </p>
            <p class="support-meta">GPA 3.93/4.30 · Summa Cum Laude</p>
            <p class="education-note">
              Seoul, South Korea
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="support-block" id="interests" aria-labelledby="interests-heading">
            <h2 id="interests-heading">Outside work</h2>
            <ul class="interests-list">
              <li>
                I co-authored a Korean-language guide to digital products and IT systems
                for general readers.
              </li>
              <li>
                I’m co-writing a second general-audience book about AI systems.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="section places" id="places" aria-labelledby="places-heading">
        <div class="container-inner">
          <div class="places-intro">
